  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita matuku makese, yeye wakahingana ku Kapênuma; bakatangalasha lumu ne, Yeye udi mu nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba bungi bakunguila, kamuakadi muaba, ne ku mbelu kabidi kuakadi nunku; yeye wakabambila dî diandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalua batuale muntu muikale ne disama dia kaneke kudiye, mutuala kudi bantu banai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahangabo mua kufika nʼandi ha buihi bualu bua tshisumbu tshia bantu, bakabulula tshimanu tshia musaka buludiludi buakadiye. Hakasthibululabo nunku, bakatekesha bulalu buakadi umena kaneke ulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamona Yesu ditabusha diabo, yeye wakambila umena kaneke ne, Muanʼanyi, mibi yebe yakujimishibua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bafundi bakuabo bakadi bashikamemu, bakadi badikonka munda munda ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu eu udi wakuila nunku, tshinyi. Yeye udi uhenda Nzambi; muntu kai udi mumanye mua kujimisha mibi, anu Nzambi nkayandi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamanya Yesu munda muandi ne, Badi badikonka munda nunku, yeye wakabakonka ne, Nudi nudikonkela munda muenu nunku tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshidi tshitamba butekete ntshinyi, kuambila muena kaneke ne, Mibi yebe yakujimishibua, anyi kumuambila ne, Bika, ambula bulalu buebe, ya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bua nuenu mimanye ne, Muana wa muntu udi ne bukole hatshidiye ha buloba bua kujimisha mibi (yeye wakambila muena kaneke ne), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nkuambila ne, Bika, ambula bulalu buebe, ya ku nsubu kuebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabika, wakambula bulalu buandi lukasa, wakumuka ku mpala kua bonso; bantu bonso bakakema bua bualu ebu, bakatumbisha Nzambi, bakamba ne, Katuena banze kumona bualu bu ebu diambedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wakaya kabidi ku muelelu wa dishiba; tshisumbu tshionso tshia bantu tshiakalua kudiye, yeye wakabayisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadiye uhita, wakamona Lewi muana wa Alafayo mushikame ku tshilambuidi, wakamuambila ne, Undonde. Yeye wakabika, wakamulonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakadi mushikame mu nsubu wa Lewi udia bidia; basangishi ba mulambu ba bungi ne bantu babi bakadi bashikame ne Yesu ne bayidi bandi, bakadi ba bungi, benda bamulonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamumona bafundi ba Bafalese udia ne bantu babi ne basangishi ba mulambu nunku, bakakonka bayidi bandi ne, Munyi mudiye udia unua ne basangishi ba mulambu ne bantu babi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Yesu dî diabo, wakabambila ne, Badi ne bukole kabena ne muondahi bualu, anu badi ne mabedi meme tshiakuluila bua kubikila badi bakane, nakuluila bua kubikila badi babi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayidi ba Yone ne Bafalese bakadi bajila bia kudia, bakahia kudi Yesu, bakamukonka ne, Bayidi ba Yone ne bayidi ba Bafalese batu bajila bia kudia, kadi bayidi bebe kabatu bajila bi kudia bualu kai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wakabambila ne, Balunda ba mubaki wa mukashi badi bamanye mua kujila bia kudia hatshidi mubaki wa mukashi nʼabo, anyi? Hatshidibo ne mubaki wa mukashi, kabena bamanye mua kujila bia kudia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi matuku nealue abanyengabo mubaki wa mukashi, nebajile bia kudia dituku adi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu kabatu batelelula tshihesa tua tshilulu tshidi katshi tshifuatalale ha tshmialu tshikulukulu, bualu bua tshihesa tshihia-tshihia netshîlamune tshikulukulu, nunku disoso nedivunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku kabidi bantu kabatu bela maluvu mahia-mahia mu milondo ya biseba bikulukulu; bienzabo nunku, malulu neahande biseba, maluvu ne biseba nebibutuke; kadi bantu batu bela malulu mahia-mahia mu biseba bihia-bihia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wakadi uhitshila mu madimi a blé dituku dia Lumingu lua Bayuda; hakadi bayidi bandi baya mu nshila, bakabanga kutshibula miehu yai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafalese bakamukonka ne, Tangila, bayidi bebe badi benzela bualu budi bujila dituku dia Lumingu tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabakonka ne, Nuenu kanuakubala bualu buakenza Davidi, hakadiye utata ne hakadiye ne nsala, yeye ne bakuabo bakadi nʼandi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabuela mu nsubu wa Nzambi hakadi Ebeyata muakuidi mimene, wakadia bidia bilesha, biakadi tshijila, anu bakuidi ba Nzambi mbakadi badia, yeye kabidi wakahaku bakadi nʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wakabambila ne, Bakenzela bantu dituku dia Lumingu, kabakenzela dituku dia Lumingu bantu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku Muana wa muntu udi mukelenge wa dituku dia Lumingu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
